### 1. Login demo (los datos seed usan {noop}demo)
POST http://localhost:8085/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "carlos",
  "password": "demo"
}

### Copiar accessToken de la respuesta
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN
@contextId = 2

### 2. Quién soy
GET http://localhost:8085/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Contextos disponibles
GET http://localhost:8085/api/auth/contexts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Activar/inspeccionar un contexto
POST http://localhost:8085/api/auth/contexts/{{contextId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Endpoint protegido
GET http://localhost:8085/api/entities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Context-Id: {{contextId}}

### 6. Logout
POST http://localhost:8085/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
